<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 0s"><span style="color: #2450E6">$</span> vrt secret put --root /data greeting-secret</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 0.8s; color: #5B6678"># value read from stdin, stored outside config</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 1.8s"><span style="color: #2450E6">$</span> vrt deploy --root /data ./standalone-hello</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 2.6s; color: #5B6678"># bundle → sign → publish new revision</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 3.6s"><span style="color: #2450E6">$</span> curl -H 'Host: hello.vrt.local' \</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 3.6s">    http://127.0.0.1:8080/</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 4.6s; color: #5B6678"># served by workerd, routed by Host</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 5.6s"><span style="color: #2450E6">$</span> vrt rollback …</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 6.4s; color: #5B6678"># re-point to an earlier signed version</div>
<div style="animation: of-line 14s linear infinite both; animation-delay: 7.4s"><span style="color: #2450E6">$</span> <span style="display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 15px; vertical-align: -2px; background: #2450E6; animation: of-blink 1s step-end infinite"></span></div>
